{
  "id": "inlay_hints/type_hints/02_type_sugar",
  "topic": "inlay_hints",
  "subtopic": "type_hints",
  "title": "Type sugar length limits",
  "summary": "Aliases keep their spelling, and an over-long type keeps what of it fits",
  "prose": "A type too long for the limit writes the template arguments that do not fit as `…`, keeping its outermost name; a type whose outermost name does not fit shows nothing. Default template arguments never print. The limit is `inlay_hints.max_length.types`; `0` lifts it.",
  "status": "supported",
  "issues": [
    "clangd#1298",
    "clangd#1357",
    "clangd#2268"
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "main.cpp",
      "text": "using Integer = int;\n\nInteger make_alias();\n\ntemplate <typename A, typename B, typename C>\nstruct extremely_long_template_name {};\n\nusing Compact = extremely_long_template_name<int, char, bool>;\n\nCompact make_compact();\n\nextremely_long_template_name<Integer, Integer, Integer> make_long();\n\ntemplate <typename... Ts>\nstruct tuple {};\n\ntuple<int, double, extremely_long_template_name<int, char, bool>> make_mixed();\n\ntemplate <typename A, typename B>\nstruct Pair {};\n\ntuple<int, Pair<long, extremely_long_template_name<int, char, bool>>> make_nested();\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct an_extraordinarily_long_class_name {};\n\nan_extraordinarily_long_class_name<int> make_far();\n\ntemplate <typename F>\nstruct function {};\n\nfunction<auto(const char*)->bool> make_callback();\n\ntemplate <typename T, typename U = int>\nstruct Defaulted {};\n\nDefaulted<float> make_defaulted();\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct Capacity {\n    static constexpr unsigned value = 4;\n};\n\ntemplate <typename T, unsigned N = Capacity<T>::value>\nstruct Small {};\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct Box {\n    T& front();\n};\n\nBox<Small<int>>& boxes();\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nusing List = tuple<T>;\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nusing Names = List<T>;\n\nNames<int> make_names();\n\nvoid use() {\n    auto aliased = make_alias();\n    auto shortened = make_compact();\n    auto elided = make_long();\n    auto mixed = make_mixed();\n    auto nested = make_nested();\n    auto dropped = make_far();\n    auto callback = make_callback();\n    auto defaulted = make_defaulted();\n    auto& small = boxes().front();\n    auto names = make_names();\n}\n",
      "markers": []
    }
  ],
